OL,3,AHarry Styles, Cher, Sam Fender and
OL,4,ABillie Eilish to headline Glastonbury
OL,5,A2027
OL,6,
OL,7,FHarry Styles will make his Glastonbury
OL,8,Ffestival debut next year as one of the
OL,9,Fevent's headliners, alongside Sam
OL,10,FFender and Billie Eilish - with Cher
OL,11,Famong the other stars on the bill.
OL,13,FThe veteran US pop icon will play the
OL,14,Fcoveted Sunday afternoon "legends"
OL,15,Fslot, which is often considered a
OL,16,Ffourth headline set. It will be her
OL,17,Fonly UK festival appearance of the
OL,18,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
